    ATK for each card destroyed by this effect, until the end of this turn. During
    your opponent''s Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this Synchro Summoned
    card; Special Summon up to 2 Level 7 WIND Synchro Monsters with different names
    from each other from your Extra Deck.'
